msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.2027.becomesTrue"
msgstr "At least one team we can name, ours included, passes every F4 gate for a full quarter and publishes the numbers."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.2027.p1"
msgstr "The first teams, small ones, ship majority-agent code without reading every line, and their defect rates hold. Nothing mystical behind it: review layers, canaries, fast rollback, and a habit of writing specifications instead of code."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.2027.p2"
msgstr "Everyone argues about whether this generalizes. That argument is the sign the level was reached."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.2027.period"
msgstr "2027"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.2027.title"
