#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.becomesTrueLabel"
msgstr "What has to become true"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.early2026.becomesTrue"
msgstr "Agent reviewers catch planted regressions at parity with median human reviewers in blind tests."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.early2026.p1"
msgstr "Writing code is no longer where engineer hours go. Reading it is. Teams that adopted parallel agents in 2025 hit the wall first: ten agents can produce more diffs before lunch than a team can honestly review by Friday."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.early2026.p2"
msgstr "The response: agents review agents, and humans sample instead of reading everything. Trust is earned statistically, not per diff."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.early2026.period"
msgstr "Early 2026"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.early2026.title"
msgstr "Review becomes the bottleneck"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.eyebrow"
msgstr "The forecast"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.intro"
msgstr "Part record, part bet. The first two entries are already happening. The rest is stated concretely enough to be wrong about."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.late2026.becomesTrue"
msgstr "Unattended runs of 8 hours or more succeed on a majority of routine tickets without a human unblocking them."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.late2026.p1"
msgstr "Long-horizon reliability crosses a threshold. Work assigned at 6pm is mergeable at 9am often enough that not scheduling the overnight shift feels like leaving a factory idle."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.late2026.p2"
msgstr "Environment setup, flaky tests, and credential plumbing, the boring failure modes that killed unattended runs in 2025, are mostly engineered away rather than modeled away."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.late2026.period"
msgstr "Late 2026"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.late2026.title"
msgstr "The overnight shift"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.mid2026.becomesTrue"
msgstr "One engineer sustains 10 or more concurrent workstreams, and merge-conflict resolution between agent branches is itself mostly automated."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.mid2026.p1"
msgstr "The job description shifts. Engineers stop being typists with taste and become dispatchers with taste: decomposing work, routing it to fleets, arbitrating conflicts between agents that both touched the same module."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.mid2026.p2"
msgstr "Tools that treat agents as a fleet, not a chat window, become the default interface to the codebase."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.forecast.mid2026.period"
msgstr "Mid 2026"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
