#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.hero.rubricNote"
msgstr "Predictions about AI are cheap because nobody checks them. This page is a rubric, not a vibe: every gate below is either true or false of a real team shipping real software. We update it as gates open, and we do not move the goalposts."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.hero.title"
msgstr "The self-driving software factory"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f0.description"
msgstr "Humans write every line. Tools compile, lint, and complain. The keyboard is the factory."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f0.era"
msgstr "Most of software history"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f0.gate1"
msgstr "None. This is the floor."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f0.name"
msgstr "Manual"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f1.description"
msgstr "Autocomplete gets good. A model suggests the next few tokens, but nothing ships without a human typing most of it."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f1.era"
msgstr "2021 to 2023"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f1.gate1"
msgstr "Model-suggested code appears in a majority of new files."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f1.gate2"
msgstr "Nobody reviews differently because of it."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f1.name"
msgstr "Assisted"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f2.description"
msgstr "An agent writes whole functions and files while a human watches every step and approves every command. One agent, one human. Faster, but still serial."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f2.era"
msgstr "2024"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f2.gate1"
msgstr "An agent completes multi-file changes end to end."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f2.gate2"
msgstr "The human reads every line before it merges."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f2.gate3"
msgstr "One human drives at most one agent at a time."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f2.name"
msgstr "Supervised"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.badge"
msgstr "Where serious teams are"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.description"
msgstr "The agent owns a task from ticket to diff. The human reviews the result, not the keystrokes. Attention shifts from writing code to specifying work and judging it. One engineer runs several agents at once in isolated workspaces."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.era"
msgstr "2025 to now"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.gate.parallel"
msgstr "One engineer sustains 3 or more agent workstreams through a workday."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.gate.routine"
msgstr "Agents complete routine tickets with no mid-task intervention."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.gate.zeroEdit"
msgstr "The majority of merged agent PRs need review only, with zero human edits."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f3.name"
msgstr "Delegated"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.badge"
msgstr "The factory"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.description"
msgstr "Fleets of agents plan, implement, review, and test each other's work. Humans set direction, arbitrate exceptions, and own taste. The unit of human attention is no longer the pull request. It is the decision."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.era"
msgstr "The 2026 bet"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.gate.latency"
msgstr "Median ticket-to-production time under one day for routine work."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.gate.majority"
msgstr "More than half of merged changes are written by agents with zero human edits."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.gate.overnight"
msgstr "Overnight and weekend runs complete unattended and are mergeable in the morning."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.gate.parallel"
msgstr "One engineer sustains 10 or more concurrent workstreams without dropped state."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.gate.review"
msgstr "Agent review catches regressions at parity with human review on the same diffs."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f4.name"
msgstr "Orchestrated"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.badge"
msgstr "Full self-driving"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.description"
msgstr "Outcome in, software out. Humans specify intent, constraints, and budget. The factory schedules itself, ships continuously, monitors what it shipped, and rolls itself back. Most changes merge with no human in the loop, and the incident rate does not rise."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.era"
msgstr "Not a 2026 claim"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.gate1"
msgstr "A majority of production changes merge without any human reading the diff."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.gate2"
msgstr "Change-failure rate at or below the human-era baseline for two consecutive quarters."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.gate3"
msgstr "The factory reverts its own bad deploys faster than a human on-call did."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.gate4"
msgstr "Humans in the loop are there for judgment calls, not throughput."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.f5.name"
msgstr "Autonomous"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.level.gateJumpTitle"
msgstr "See this gate on the scorecard"

