#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.rubric.intro"
msgstr "Borrowed from how self-driving cars are graded, applied to how software gets built. The interesting jump is F3 to F4: from agents you delegate to, to a factory you direct."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "marketing.factory.rubric.title"
msgstr "Six levels of factory autonomy"

